.SH NAME
ivcap-account-invite - Invite a user to an account


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBivcap account invite account_id --email  [--capability  ...] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Invite a user (by email) to an account, granting the given capabilities when they
accept. Omit --capability for a read-only member. If no capabilities are given and
you are on an interactive terminal, you will be prompted to choose.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-c\fP, \fB--capability\fP=[]
	Capability to grant on accept (repeatable). Run 'ivcap capabilities --kind account' to list valid values

.PP
\fB-e\fP, \fB--email\fP=""
	Invitee email address

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
